title: AffinityTest
---
<<declare $selectedPath = "">>

Narrator: The stars burn cold above the temple. The gods watch. The city sleeps.
NPC_GodA: Mortal. You stand at a crossroads. Choose carefully when dawn comes.

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓁐𓃀:Path_A|𓁷𓎟𓅓:Path_B|𓌱𓈖𓅓:Path_C|𓎟𓀀𓈖:Path_D>>
NPC_Human1: Four symbols are carved above the gate. Which do you trace? <br> Find 𓀀𓁐𓃀 — the mark of GodA. <br>Find 𓁷𓎟𓅓 — the mark of GodB.<br>Find 𓌱𓈖𓅓 — the mark of HumanA.<br>Find 𓎟𓀀𓈖 — the mark of HumanB. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    NPC_Human1: You trace the mark of GodA. The air grows warm.
    <<addgodaffinity Thoth 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    NPC_Human1: You trace the mark of GodB. Shadows gather at your feet.
    <<addgodaffinity Bast 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_C">>
    NPC_Human1: You trace the mark of HumanA. The crowd murmurs approval.
    <<addhumanaffinity Nitiqret 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_D">>
    NPC_Human1: You trace the mark of HumanB. A merchant nods from across the square.
    <<addhumanaffinity Harwa 2>>
<<endif>>

<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: Night returns. The choice settles into your bones.

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓃀𓁐:Path_A|𓅓𓎟𓁷:Path_B|𓈖𓌱𓅓:Path_C|𓀀𓎟𓈖:Path_D>>
NPC_Human2: A second gate. A second choice. The symbols shift.<br> Find 𓀀𓃀𓁐 — the sun godGodC calls again.<br> Find 𓅓𓎟𓁷 — the river godGodD beckons.<br> Find 𓈖𓌱𓅓 — the scholarsHumanC have a task for you.<br> Find 𓀀𓎟𓈖 — the merchantsHumanD need a decision. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    NPC_Human2: The sun gods GodC influence grows stronger around you.
    <<addgodaffinity Bes 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    NPC_Human2: The river gods GodD current pulls at your steps.
    <<addgodaffinity Sekhmet 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_C">>
    NPC_Human2: The scholars Human C will remember your name.
    <<addhumanaffinity Ptahhotep 2>>
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_D">>
    NPC_Human2: The merchant Human D quarter opens its doors to you.
    <<addhumanaffinity Chaos 2>>
<<endif>>

<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: The final night descends. All choices are made. The stars align.
<<checkending>>

===

